### Enforcement Site 12: SSE Hub delivery filtering (`canReceive`)

**File:** `/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/sse_hub.go`, lines 134-144

Live server-sent events carry memo visibility metadata. The hub filters delivery per-client:

```go
func (c *SSEClient) canReceive(event *SSEEvent) bool {
    switch event.Visibility {
    case store.Private:
        return c.userID == event.CreatorID || c.role == store.RoleAdmin
    case store.Public, store.Protected, "":
        return true
    default:
        return false
    }
}
```

The `Visibility` and `CreatorID` fields on `SSEEvent` (line 32-33) are tagged `json:"-"` so they are never leaked to clients.

